eI8k3MVkcB6nheYX40jqN0idqAXrfXBVyKVCBcilQ\"/><figure><img alt=\"周潤發在開幕儀式舉起手機與參與人士自拍。（方承恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197973534614360064960718.jpeg/YPFSSqxZCt465rzR9kk2C4doCXMPd1Jq8Q7CF9QOwhc\"/><figcaption>周潤發在開幕儀式舉起手機與參與人士自拍。（方承恩攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.523882+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2219,"images":26,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:03:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:41.544393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:58.105741+00:00","content_hash":"30247cfb6d3f554d611096b5d75b88a9fd2fdc03b47bc2c84e566a590238e04a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}